{"ID":"20240205164742-zl2nnk7","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205164742-zl2nnk7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164742-zl2nnk7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093910-gfmght3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165502-j9y3f8x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:500,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093910-gfmght3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:179,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:179\u0026#125;","title":"白扁豆","type":"doc","updated":"20240902111541"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093910-gfmght3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093910-gfmght3","updated":"20240206093919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于安徽、陕西、湖南、河南等地。\n【性状】\t种子扁椭圆形或扁卵圆形，长0.81.3cm，宽69mm，厚约7mm。表面淡黄白色或淡黄色，平滑，稍有光泽，有的可见棕褐色斑点，一侧边缘有隆起的白色半月形种阜。长7"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10mm，剥去后可见凹陷的种脐，紧接种阜的一端有珠孔，另端有种脊。质坚硬，种皮薄而脆，子叶2片，肥厚，黄白色。气微，味淡，嚼之有豆腥气。\n【性味】\t甘，微温。\n【功效】\t补脾和中，化湿消暑。用于脾胃虚弱、食欲不振、大便溏泻、白带过多、暑湿吐泻、胸闷腹胀。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093911-83p7kn7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093911-83p7kn7","updated":"20240206093911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093911-rs3pkly.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165502-j9y3f8x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165502-j9y3f8x","updated":"20240205165502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白扁豆"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白扁豆-20240205165502-v5by1qr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717154424-5lzqi32","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717154424-5lzqi32","updated":"20240717154424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 581px;","style":"width: 571px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白扁豆"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白扁豆-20240717154424-3dj829t.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 571px;\" parent-style=\"width: 581px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717155841-2m2wweg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240717155841-2m2wweg","updated":"20240717155845"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 361px;","style":"width: 351px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白扁豆 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白扁豆 12-20240717155841-rvc7df7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 351px;\" parent-style=\"width: 361px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 380px;","style":"width: 370px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"白扁豆 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/白扁豆 13-20240717155845-e0wrq1i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 370px;\" parent-style=\"width: 380px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240717154710-cugytuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":